 "sentences": [
  "Over 1,000 visitors dived into NASA sea level science.",
  "This happened on World Ocean Day at the UGA Aquarium.",
  "Guests played a tumbling tower game to show rising sea impacts.",
  "They also made friendship bracelets with beads representing local sea level rise.",
  "A new augmented reality sandbox let users test coastal resilience strategies.",
  "People shaped sand while NASA projections transformed their landscapes in real time."
